cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or build on ART-VS, please cite the paper below."
title: "ART-VS: Adaptive Resolution Tiling for Vision Transformer Visual Servoing"
abstract: >-
  ART-VS is a training-free, backbone-agnostic visual servoing method that adapts
  Vision Transformer feature granularity to servoing progress: a coarse phase at the
  ViT's native resolution for robust initial alignment, followed by a tiled
  high-resolution refinement phase for precise positioning.
